ые розы из крем-чиза, воздушные шапочки капкейков и пышный зефир. Бесшовная японская сталь 304 и нескользящие мешки высокой плотности.<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;/p&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;div className="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2"&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;button&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; onClick={() =&gt; { setSelectedCategory('nozzles'); }}<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; className="bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition"<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Каталог насадок<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;/button&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;button&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; onClick={() =&gt; { setSelectedCategory('sets'); }}<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; className="bg-white border border-stone-300 text-stone-800 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-stone-50 transition shadow-sm"<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Готовые наборы<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;/button&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;/div&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;/div&gt;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;div className="relative flex justify-center md:justify-end"&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 max-w-md"&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &lt;img&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578985545062-69928b1d9587?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=500&amp;q=